1
00:00:13,263 --> 00:00:15,432
<i>‎Akane, aku dah balik.</i>

2
00:00:16,099 --> 00:00:18,309
‎Itu yang aku nak cakap...

3
00:00:19,936 --> 00:00:22,647
‎tapi aku kena pergi sekarang.

4
00:00:24,024 --> 00:00:26,609
‎Tolong jangan tanya.
‎Aku tak boleh beritahu kau.

5
00:00:27,193 --> 00:00:30,280
‎Tapi aku boleh beritahu kau satu perkara.

6
00:00:31,781 --> 00:00:35,410
‎Aku akan kembali sebagai lelaki sejati
‎apabila kau tengok aku nanti.

7
00:00:36,077 --> 00:00:37,369
‎Tolonglah.

8
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:41,332
‎Keluar...

9
00:00:44,127 --> 00:00:46,336
‎Aku tak boleh cakap! Malunya nak cakap,

10
00:00:46,337 --> 00:00:49,006
‎"Keluar dengan aku!"

11
00:00:49,007 --> 00:00:52,843
‎Hei! Berhenti, orang tua gatal!

12
00:00:52,844 --> 00:00:54,971
‎Seronoknya cuci mata!

13
00:00:55,597 --> 00:00:56,973
‎Tangkap dia cepat!

14
00:01:04,064 --> 00:01:07,399
‎Aduh. Tangkas betul orang tua itu.

15
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:09,985
‎Setiap hari dia datang ke sekolah.

16
00:01:09,986 --> 00:01:12,988
‎Kita tak boleh asyik kejar dia
‎selepas dia kacau kita.

17
00:01:12,989 --> 00:01:14,823
‎Kau ada rancangan, Akane?

18
00:01:14,824 --> 00:01:15,825
‎Ada.

19
00:01:16,493 --> 00:01:17,701
‎Kalau kita buat begini?

20
00:01:17,702 --> 00:01:20,621
‎Kita ada kelas gim esok, bukan?

21
00:01:20,622 --> 00:01:21,664
‎Jadi, kita...

22
00:01:23,208 --> 00:01:26,919
‎Ryoga. Buat apa di bawah?

23
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:27,921
‎Hei.

24
00:01:29,964 --> 00:01:33,927
‎RANMA1/2

25
00:02:59,053 --> 00:03:02,014
‎Kau nak berjalan jauh lagi, Ryoga?

26
00:03:02,015 --> 00:03:04,641
{\an8}‎MENCARI KOLAM AIR PANAS TERSEMBUNYI

27
00:03:04,642 --> 00:03:06,561
{\an8}‎Ya. Entah bila kita boleh jumpa lagi.

28
00:03:07,061 --> 00:03:10,355
‎Kenapa tak jumpa Ranma dulu?
‎Dah lama tak jumpa, bukan?

29
00:03:10,356 --> 00:03:12,149
‎Aku tak nak tengok muka dia.

30
00:03:12,150 --> 00:03:13,401
‎Faham.

31
00:03:15,570 --> 00:03:19,157
‎Tapi kamu rapat juga, bukan?

32
00:03:19,741 --> 00:03:22,827
‎Sebab kamu kerap berlawan.

33
00:03:24,203 --> 00:03:25,705
‎Sebenarnya, Akane...

34
00:03:34,297 --> 00:03:36,841
‎- Nanti aku...
‎- Ya?

35
00:03:37,425 --> 00:03:39,802
‎Nanti aku balik, tolong...

36
00:03:40,595 --> 00:03:41,887
‎Apa?

37
00:03:41,888 --> 00:03:44,890
‎Keluar...

38
00:03:44,891 --> 00:03:46,809
‎Terimalah hadiah tak seberapa ini.

39
00:03:48,311 --> 00:03:50,103
‎Terima kasih beri buah tangan.

40
00:03:50,104 --> 00:03:52,273
‎Kau memang baik.

41
00:03:54,859 --> 00:03:57,862
‎Okey, jaga diri. Selamat jalan.

42
00:04:00,406 --> 00:04:02,783
‎Tak guna!

43
00:04:02,784 --> 00:04:03,993
‎Ryoga.

44
00:04:04,994 --> 00:04:06,286
‎- Akane?
‎- Lupa beri kau

45
00:04:06,287 --> 00:04:07,956
‎ciuman selamat tinggal.

46
00:04:10,291 --> 00:04:12,085
‎Tapi, Akane,

47
00:04:12,627 --> 00:04:16,421
‎pegang tangan pun belum...

48
00:04:16,422 --> 00:04:19,466
‎Aku belum sedia untuk ini...

49
00:04:19,467 --> 00:04:20,969
‎Okey, tak apalah.

50
00:04:25,181 --> 00:04:27,015
‎Ganas betul dia.

51
00:04:27,016 --> 00:04:29,393
‎Dah lama kita tak jumpa.

52
00:04:29,394 --> 00:04:33,064
‎Diam. Berani kau
‎permainkan hati anak muda.

53
00:04:33,648 --> 00:04:35,775
‎Kenapa kau marah sangat, P-chan?

54
00:04:39,988 --> 00:04:42,114
‎Sayangnya, Ranma.

55
00:04:42,115 --> 00:04:45,076
‎Tak lama lagi,
‎kau takkan jumpa P-chan lagi.

56
00:04:47,036 --> 00:04:49,622
‎Inilah sebabnya.

57
00:04:50,248 --> 00:04:51,749
‎Ini peta apa?

58
00:04:52,458 --> 00:04:53,835
‎Peta harta karun?

59
00:04:54,335 --> 00:04:56,129
‎Bodoh. Pulangkan!

60
00:04:57,046 --> 00:04:58,548
‎Kau...

61
00:05:03,803 --> 00:05:04,929
‎Alamak.

62
00:05:06,472 --> 00:05:10,059
‎Kolam Lelaki Lemas Jepun!

63
00:05:16,983 --> 00:05:18,860
‎Kolam Lelaki Lemas Jepun?

64
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:23,864
<i>‎Lama dahulu,</i>

65
00:05:23,865 --> 00:05:29,162
<i>‎di wilayah Musashi, rubah mengganggu
‎hidup manusia dengan kenakalannya.</i>

66
00:05:29,746 --> 00:05:33,540
<i>‎Satu hari, seorang sami
‎yang melawat dari China</i>

67
00:05:33,541 --> 00:05:38,004
<i>‎menghentakkan tongkatnya ke tanah
‎dan kolam air panas membuak-buak keluar.</i>

68
00:05:39,255 --> 00:05:42,174
<i>‎Semua rubah yang mandi
‎di kolam air panas ini</i>

69
00:05:42,175 --> 00:05:46,846
<i>‎tiba-tiba bertukar menjadi lelaki manusia.</i>

70
00:05:48,056 --> 00:05:52,893
<i>‎Disebabkan itu,
‎tiada lagi rubah nakal yang tinggal.</i>

71
00:05:52,894 --> 00:05:56,105
<i>‎Malangnya, orang kampung
‎mendapat masalah baru.</i>

72
00:05:57,940 --> 00:06:02,153
‎Itu memang Kolam Lelaki Lemas.

73
00:06:03,362 --> 00:06:06,406
<i>‎Kalau berendam dalam kolam itu,
‎aku boleh hilangkan sumpahan ini.</i>

74
00:06:06,407 --> 00:06:07,450
‎KOLAM LELAKI LEMAS

75
00:06:08,034 --> 00:06:09,869
<i>‎Barulah aku boleh kekal jadi lelaki.</i>

76
00:06:12,622 --> 00:06:14,040
‎Itulah ceritanya.

77
00:06:14,874 --> 00:06:16,250
‎Aku nak pergi ke sana.

78
00:06:17,877 --> 00:06:20,171
‎Sekejap, tunggu, Ryoga.

79
00:06:20,922 --> 00:06:23,298
‎Bekerjasama? Jangan buat lawaklah.

80
00:06:23,299 --> 00:06:26,009
‎Aku kata aku boleh bawa kau ke sana.

81
00:06:26,010 --> 00:06:28,178
‎Aku tak perlukan bantuan kau.

82
00:06:28,179 --> 00:06:30,388
‎Aku ada peta.

83
00:06:30,389 --> 00:06:33,059
‎Kau buta arah. Ada peta pun tak guna.

84
00:06:34,310 --> 00:06:38,063
‎Tak lama lagi, aku dah tak jadi khinzir.

85
00:06:38,064 --> 00:06:39,565
‎Sedihnya.

86
00:06:43,402 --> 00:06:46,614
‎Hei. Itu jalan mati.

87
00:06:48,366 --> 00:06:51,368
‎Kalau terus berjalan, sampai juga nanti.

88
00:06:51,369 --> 00:06:54,497
‎Kolam Lelaki Lemas Jepun
‎sedang menunggu aku.

89
00:06:55,832 --> 00:06:58,126
‎Sinilah. Biar aku tengok.

90
00:06:59,335 --> 00:07:01,670
‎Selepas ini, aku saja jadi lelaki sejati...

91
00:07:01,671 --> 00:07:02,964
‎Ikut sinilah.

92
00:07:03,464 --> 00:07:06,092
‎Budak bodoh itu salah jalan.

93
00:07:06,759 --> 00:07:08,845
‎Tak guna! Pulangkan!

94
00:07:10,346 --> 00:07:12,722
‎Bangun. Tunduk.

95
00:07:12,723 --> 00:07:15,058
‎Selepas ini, kelas gim.

96
00:07:15,059 --> 00:07:17,978
‎Mesti orang tua gatal itu
‎nak kacau kita lagi.

97
00:07:17,979 --> 00:07:19,021
‎Aduh.

98
00:07:20,565 --> 00:07:23,733
‎Jangan risau. Dia takkan boleh kacau kita.

99
00:07:23,734 --> 00:07:26,319
‎Akane, kau buat apa?

100
00:07:26,320 --> 00:07:27,613
‎Tengoklah.

101
00:07:33,369 --> 00:07:36,538
‎Hei, Ranma. Betulkah ini tempatnya?

102
00:07:36,539 --> 00:07:38,582
‎Bukankah ini kebun
‎belakang sekolah tinggi?

103
00:07:38,583 --> 00:07:39,959
‎Di sinilah tempatnya.

104
00:07:40,585 --> 00:07:44,754
‎Ikut peta ini,
‎patung rubah ini pembayang penting...

105
00:07:44,755 --> 00:07:47,341
‎Terima kasih sebab tunjukkan jalan.

106
00:07:49,051 --> 00:07:52,429
‎Berjalan 100 langkah
‎ikut arah patung ini menuding.

107
00:07:52,430 --> 00:07:55,141
‎Di situlah Kolam Lelaki Lemas!

108
00:07:57,018 --> 00:07:58,603
‎Tak guna. Tunggu aku.

109
00:07:59,562 --> 00:08:00,897
‎Jangan ikut aku.

110
00:08:01,564 --> 00:08:03,106
‎Pengecut.

111
00:08:03,107 --> 00:08:05,276
‎Kau nak sangat mula dulu?

112
00:08:05,860 --> 00:08:08,029
‎Diam! Kau yang nak ikut aku.

113
00:08:08,696 --> 00:08:10,614
‎Aku bawa kau ke sini!

114
00:08:10,615 --> 00:08:14,576
‎Lapan puluh empat, 85, 86.
‎Di bawah bangunan itu?

115
00:08:14,577 --> 00:08:17,163
‎Sembilan puluh dua, 93, 94.

116
00:08:39,519 --> 00:08:41,811
‎Apa? Orang tua itu tak ada.

117
00:08:41,812 --> 00:08:42,813
‎Dia dah lari!

118
00:08:43,439 --> 00:08:44,732
‎Maknanya...

119
00:08:45,483 --> 00:08:47,108
‎Mesti dia akan datang balik.

120
00:08:47,109 --> 00:08:49,194
‎Kemudian, kita lawan dia habis-habisan.

121
00:08:49,195 --> 00:08:50,862
‎Akane, aku tolong.

122
00:08:50,863 --> 00:08:53,573
‎- Aku pun.
‎- Sembilan puluh sembilan, 99, 100.

123
00:08:53,574 --> 00:08:56,826
‎Kolam itu di bawah bilik lokar perempuan.

124
00:08:56,827 --> 00:08:58,704
‎Di situ Kolam Lelaki Lemas?

125
00:08:59,205 --> 00:09:00,956
‎Ya, aku pasti.

126
00:09:00,957 --> 00:09:03,501
<i>‎Tak guna. Tak kira siapa halang aku...</i>

127
00:09:04,710 --> 00:09:07,295
‎Aku takkan berpatah balik.

128
00:09:07,296 --> 00:09:08,798
‎Kita kena bekerjasama.

129
00:09:11,259 --> 00:09:13,134
‎Semua orang dah sedia?

130
00:09:13,135 --> 00:09:16,346
‎Kita pertahankan
‎dan lindungi bilik lokar perempuan.

131
00:09:16,347 --> 00:09:17,557
‎- Ya!
‎- Ya!

132
00:09:18,140 --> 00:09:20,809
‎- Satu, dua.
‎- <i>‎Satu, dua.</i>

133
00:09:20,810 --> 00:09:25,355
‎- Satu, dua.
‎- Tuan. Tuan tak ke sekolah?

134
00:09:25,356 --> 00:09:27,358
‎- Ya, saya pergi nanti.
‎- <i>‎Satu, dua.</i>

135
00:09:29,068 --> 00:09:30,527
‎Semuanya dah sedia.

136
00:09:30,528 --> 00:09:33,071
‎Aku dah siap jadi perempuan.

137
00:09:33,072 --> 00:09:37,701
‎Ranma, jangan kata
‎kau nak masuk ikut pintu depan?

138
00:09:37,702 --> 00:09:39,035
‎Mestilah.

139
00:09:39,036 --> 00:09:42,581
‎Tak boleh! Akane salin baju di dalam.

140
00:09:42,582 --> 00:09:46,751
‎Hei, jangan lupa sebab kita ke sini.

141
00:09:46,752 --> 00:09:50,131
‎Kolam Lelaki Lemas
‎ada di bawah bilik lokar perempuan.

142
00:09:53,134 --> 00:09:56,094
‎Hei, betulkah orang tua itu nak datang?

143
00:09:56,095 --> 00:09:57,388
‎Dia akan datang.

144
00:09:58,014 --> 00:10:01,475
‎Kita akan musnahkan dia hari ini.

145
00:10:02,143 --> 00:10:04,269
‎Kalau tak, tak tenang nak salin baju.

146
00:10:04,270 --> 00:10:07,940
‎- Alamak. Aku tertinggal barang.
‎- Ya.

147
00:10:10,735 --> 00:10:14,739
‎Bodoh. Kenapa tak sebut
‎kata laluan sebelum masuk?

148
00:10:15,573 --> 00:10:18,658
‎Maaf. Aku lupalah.

149
00:10:18,659 --> 00:10:22,120
‎Okey, Kolam Lelaki Lemas.
‎Mana Kolam Lelaki Lemas?

150
00:10:22,121 --> 00:10:24,582
‎Ranma. Kau buat apa?

151
00:10:25,499 --> 00:10:28,210
‎Arah ini. Jaraknya...

152
00:10:29,462 --> 00:10:32,173
‎- Mungkin di sini...
‎- Kau buat apa?

153
00:10:33,382 --> 00:10:36,134
‎- Tak tahu malu!
‎- Jangan!

154
00:10:36,135 --> 00:10:39,095
‎- Akane! Tenang dulu.
‎- Tenang.

155
00:10:39,096 --> 00:10:40,305
‎Kau okey?

156
00:10:40,306 --> 00:10:42,599
‎Jahatnya kau, Akane.

157
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:44,684
‎Kau!

158
00:10:44,685 --> 00:10:46,812
<i>‎Mereka tak tahu ini aku.</i>

159
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:49,314
<i>‎Mujur aku menyamar.</i>

160
00:10:49,315 --> 00:10:51,066
‎Kau keluar sekarang.

161
00:10:51,067 --> 00:10:53,986
‎Apa salahnya perempuan
‎masuk ke bilik lokar perempuan...

162
00:10:55,321 --> 00:10:57,948
‎Kalau kau tak nak jadi lelaki sekarang...

163
00:10:59,784 --> 00:11:01,785
‎berambus!

164
00:11:01,786 --> 00:11:03,745
‎Perempuan ganas!

165
00:11:03,746 --> 00:11:05,915
‎Ganas apa? Kau yang mengintai!

166
00:11:09,919 --> 00:11:13,756
‎Tapi aku tak lemah macam kau.
‎Campak air pun tak kena.

167
00:11:16,092 --> 00:11:19,095
‎Itu Ranma, budak kelas sebelah.

168
00:11:19,637 --> 00:11:22,264
‎- Dia pakai seluar aku.
‎- Apa? Nak tengok.

169
00:11:24,725 --> 00:11:26,519
‎Tak guna!

170
00:11:28,938 --> 00:11:30,355
‎Padan muka kau.

171
00:11:30,356 --> 00:11:34,777
‎Tak guna. Kenapa kau santai sangat?

172
00:11:37,321 --> 00:11:39,739
‎Sudah. Aku nak jadi lelaki juga,

173
00:11:39,740 --> 00:11:41,659
‎tak kira apa.

174
00:11:42,410 --> 00:11:43,744
‎Dengar sini, Ryoga.

175
00:11:44,620 --> 00:11:46,997
‎Curi baju mereka, kemudian lari laju-laju.

176
00:11:47,665 --> 00:11:50,166
‎Sementara Akane dan mereka kejar kau,

177
00:11:50,167 --> 00:11:52,585
‎aku gali Kolam Lelaki Lemas.

178
00:11:52,586 --> 00:11:53,629
‎Faham?

179
00:11:54,630 --> 00:11:56,340
‎Jangan merengek. Masuk cepat.

180
00:11:59,593 --> 00:12:01,136
‎P-chan datang?

181
00:12:01,137 --> 00:12:03,222
‎- Comelnya!
‎- P-chan?

182
00:12:07,268 --> 00:12:09,645
‎Awak hilang ke mana, P-chan?

183
00:12:20,281 --> 00:12:22,908
‎- Hei, hidungnya berdarah.
‎- P-chan?

184
00:12:33,711 --> 00:12:35,838
‎Tak guna. Bangun!

185
00:12:40,217 --> 00:12:42,052
‎Maaf mengganggu.

186
00:12:48,267 --> 00:12:50,644
‎Bertuahnya hidup aku.

187
00:12:51,270 --> 00:12:54,189
‎Tak sia-sia jadi khinzir.

188
00:12:54,190 --> 00:12:56,900
‎Kau merepek apa?

189
00:12:56,901 --> 00:13:00,112
‎Mana lagi penting? Seronok sekejap
‎atau Kolam Lelaki Lemas?

190
00:13:00,696 --> 00:13:02,697
‎Seronok sekejap.

191
00:13:02,698 --> 00:13:05,576
<i>‎Cepat betul Ranma hilang.</i>

192
00:13:07,036 --> 00:13:09,288
‎Ryoga, bukankah kau dah pergi?

193
00:13:10,581 --> 00:13:14,084
‎Akane. Terima kasih tadi.

194
00:13:16,170 --> 00:13:18,922
‎Apa? Ranma mengintai?

195
00:13:18,923 --> 00:13:22,634
‎Ya! Aku tak sangka dia buat begitu.

196
00:13:22,635 --> 00:13:24,220
‎Serahkan kepada aku.

197
00:13:24,762 --> 00:13:27,430
‎Sebagai lelaki, aku tak boleh biarkan.

198
00:13:27,431 --> 00:13:31,476
‎Terima kasih. Mujur kau ada di sini.

199
00:13:31,477 --> 00:13:35,188
‎Biasa saja, aku cuma
‎nak tolong kau, Akane.

200
00:13:35,189 --> 00:13:36,357
‎Terima kasih.

201
00:13:37,274 --> 00:13:39,151
<i>‎Jangan harap aku putus asa.</i>

202
00:13:39,652 --> 00:13:40,653
<i>‎Berjaya.</i>

203
00:13:41,654 --> 00:13:43,280
‎Tak ada orang.

204
00:13:49,286 --> 00:13:51,038
‎Apa benda ini?

205
00:13:53,707 --> 00:13:56,460
‎Pencuri seluar dalam dah tertangkap.

206
00:13:57,002 --> 00:13:59,295
‎Ryoga, tak guna.

207
00:13:59,296 --> 00:14:01,673
‎Macam mana dengan Kolam Lelaki Lemas?

208
00:14:01,674 --> 00:14:03,383
‎Ini untuk Akane!

209
00:14:03,384 --> 00:14:06,386
‎Aku akan tumpaskan kau,
‎musuh semua wanita!

210
00:14:06,387 --> 00:14:08,180
‎Pengkhianat!

211
00:14:13,644 --> 00:14:16,312
‎- Biar dia tidur sekejap.
‎- Atuk.

212
00:14:16,313 --> 00:14:19,732
‎Hore, segunung harta karun!

213
00:14:19,733 --> 00:14:21,776
‎Cepat, nanti tak sempat.

214
00:14:21,777 --> 00:14:23,319
‎Sekejap, atuk.

215
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:25,072
‎Ini rancangan kau selama ini?

216
00:14:27,366 --> 00:14:30,786
‎Kau bersubahat dengan atuk, Ranma.

217
00:14:39,378 --> 00:14:41,170
‎Dengar sini, Ranma.

218
00:14:41,171 --> 00:14:43,715
‎Kita kena bekerjasama
‎untuk dapatkan harta karun itu.

219
00:14:43,716 --> 00:14:46,176
‎Saya tak gatal macam atuk!

220
00:14:49,263 --> 00:14:52,516
‎Ranma. Marilah kalau berani.

221
00:14:53,976 --> 00:14:56,060
‎Bersedialah, Akane.

222
00:14:56,061 --> 00:14:58,563
‎Aku akan buat apa saja

223
00:14:58,564 --> 00:15:01,482
‎untuk masuk ke bilik lokar perempuan!

224
00:15:01,483 --> 00:15:05,236
‎Syabas, Ranma.
‎Demi seluar dalam, kamu sanggup...

225
00:15:05,237 --> 00:15:07,196
‎Saya nak cari Kolam Lelaki Lemas.

226
00:15:07,197 --> 00:15:09,157
‎Apa pun,

227
00:15:09,158 --> 00:15:11,493
‎kalau nak bergaduh dengan perempuan...

228
00:15:12,036 --> 00:15:13,912
‎Bagus. Gelinya.

229
00:15:13,913 --> 00:15:14,955
‎Kuak.

230
00:15:16,290 --> 00:15:17,875
‎Ini kaedah terbaik!

231
00:15:20,419 --> 00:15:23,671
‎Tenang, semua. Ini mainan saja.

232
00:15:23,672 --> 00:15:27,300
‎Bukan! Ular betul! Katak!

233
00:15:27,301 --> 00:15:30,094
‎Betul-betul, bukan mainan!

234
00:15:30,095 --> 00:15:31,388
‎Ranma!

235
00:15:33,307 --> 00:15:34,350
‎Kuak.

236
00:15:36,435 --> 00:15:37,895
‎Kuak!

237
00:15:40,397 --> 00:15:41,565
‎Ranma.

238
00:15:48,447 --> 00:15:49,657
‎Pencuri!

239
00:15:58,040 --> 00:16:00,875
<i>‎Tak guna. Dia tahu aku menyamar?</i>

240
00:16:00,876 --> 00:16:03,503
<i>‎Aku dah menyamar betul-betul.</i>

241
00:16:03,504 --> 00:16:05,004
‎Maaf!

242
00:16:05,005 --> 00:16:06,799
‎Saya ingat awak Ranma.

243
00:16:07,716 --> 00:16:10,009
‎Teruknya awak.

244
00:16:10,010 --> 00:16:12,262
‎Saya tak buat apa-apa pun.

245
00:16:13,222 --> 00:16:14,555
‎Maaf!

246
00:16:14,556 --> 00:16:16,100
‎Maafkan saya!

247
00:16:17,601 --> 00:16:18,602
‎Tapi...

248
00:16:23,107 --> 00:16:24,315
‎saya suka awak.

249
00:16:24,316 --> 00:16:26,150
‎Apa? Sekejap.

250
00:16:26,151 --> 00:16:28,528
‎Kita baru jumpa, macam mana...

251
00:16:28,529 --> 00:16:31,447
‎Awak benci perempuan berkaca mata?

252
00:16:31,448 --> 00:16:33,658
‎Tak, tapi...

253
00:16:33,659 --> 00:16:35,660
‎saya suka orang lain...

254
00:16:35,661 --> 00:16:37,203
‎Saya tak kisah.

255
00:16:37,204 --> 00:16:38,496
‎Tapi...

256
00:16:38,497 --> 00:16:39,665
‎Betulkah?

257
00:16:40,958 --> 00:16:42,375
‎Matilah kau!

258
00:16:42,376 --> 00:16:44,877
‎Kau buat apa?

259
00:16:44,878 --> 00:16:48,214
‎Akane. Kau salah faham.

260
00:16:48,215 --> 00:16:49,841
‎Aku tak buat apa-apa...

261
00:16:49,842 --> 00:16:52,760
{\an8}‎Hei, Akane! Kenapa kau selalu kacau aku?

262
00:16:52,761 --> 00:16:57,306
‎Ranma. Kau sanggup buat kerja tak senonoh
‎semata-mata nak curi seluar dalam?

263
00:16:57,307 --> 00:17:00,685
{\an8}‎Bodoh. Aku bukan nak curi seluar dalam.

264
00:17:00,686 --> 00:17:01,937
{\an8}‎Kau nak sangat, bukan?

265
00:17:02,730 --> 00:17:04,523
‎Kau ambillah semua.

266
00:17:05,566 --> 00:17:09,277
‎Ini semua seluar dalam jerat.

267
00:17:09,278 --> 00:17:10,737
‎Bukanlah...

268
00:17:10,738 --> 00:17:13,741
‎Jadi, tolonglah.

269
00:17:14,450 --> 00:17:16,452
‎Jangan buat kerja tak senonoh lagi.

270
00:17:17,202 --> 00:17:20,372
‎Aku betul-betul ingat
‎perangai kau tak begini.

271
00:17:20,956 --> 00:17:22,040
‎Selamat tinggal!

272
00:17:22,041 --> 00:17:26,378
‎Tunggu! Aku datang sebab
‎nak gali Kolam Lelaki Lemas.

273
00:17:27,671 --> 00:17:29,048
‎Kolam Lelaki Lemas?

274
00:17:30,090 --> 00:17:33,510
‎Di bawah bilik lokar perempuan?

275
00:17:34,261 --> 00:17:36,429
‎Itukah sebabnya, Ranma?

276
00:17:36,430 --> 00:17:38,514
‎Kau ingat aku menipu?

277
00:17:38,515 --> 00:17:41,852
‎Kalau nak tipu, betul-betullah.

278
00:17:42,561 --> 00:17:46,065
‎Pandai kau menyamar tadi, Ranma.

279
00:17:47,441 --> 00:17:48,608
‎Betul.

280
00:17:48,609 --> 00:17:52,029
‎Aku tak pernah bersama
‎perempuan selama ini.

281
00:17:53,822 --> 00:17:56,824
‎Apatah lagi perempuan luahkan perasaan.

282
00:17:56,825 --> 00:18:00,620
‎Tak pernah sekali pun seumur hidup aku.

283
00:18:00,621 --> 00:18:02,288
‎Kau dengar tak?

284
00:18:02,289 --> 00:18:03,540
‎Kasihan dia.

285
00:18:05,292 --> 00:18:06,502
‎Apa masalahnya?

286
00:18:07,628 --> 00:18:10,546
‎Jujur dengan aku, Ranma.

287
00:18:10,547 --> 00:18:14,175
‎Kenapa kau buat begitu tadi?

288
00:18:14,176 --> 00:18:17,303
‎Kenapa lagi?
‎Sebab nak cari Kolam Lelaki Lemas...

289
00:18:17,304 --> 00:18:19,139
‎Maksud kau...

290
00:18:21,475 --> 00:18:23,684
‎disebabkan itu saja,

291
00:18:23,685 --> 00:18:27,897
‎kau sanggup permainkan
‎hati lelaki berulang kali?

292
00:18:27,898 --> 00:18:29,398
‎Diamlah.

293
00:18:29,399 --> 00:18:32,235
‎Kau yang tunjukkan

294
00:18:32,236 --> 00:18:34,488
‎peta Kolam Lelaki Lemas!

295
00:18:38,492 --> 00:18:41,078
‎Ryoga, betulkah?

296
00:18:41,578 --> 00:18:44,748
‎Kenapa kau ada peta Kolam Lelaki Lemas?

297
00:18:48,502 --> 00:18:50,921
‎Ryoga, jangan kata...

298
00:19:09,064 --> 00:19:10,816
<i>‎Rahsia terbongkar.</i>

299
00:19:11,483 --> 00:19:13,819
‎Kau nak hilangkan sumpahan Ranma.

300
00:19:14,653 --> 00:19:16,405
‎Baiknya kau.

301
00:19:17,322 --> 00:19:20,325
‎Mujurlah Akane tak bijak sangat,
‎bukan P-chan?

302
00:19:26,248 --> 00:19:27,291
‎Siapa...

303
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:30,627
‎kau panggil P-chan?

304
00:19:32,671 --> 00:19:34,463
‎Titik...

305
00:19:34,464 --> 00:19:37,008
‎Bukan aku, lantai!

306
00:19:37,009 --> 00:19:39,887
‎...Had!

307
00:19:55,694 --> 00:19:58,113
‎Aura ini...

308
00:20:03,577 --> 00:20:05,162
‎Berjaya.

309
00:20:16,757 --> 00:20:18,133
<i>‎Kolam Lelaki Lemas.</i>

310
00:20:19,051 --> 00:20:20,844
<i>‎Betul-betul di sini.</i>

311
00:20:22,512 --> 00:20:23,639
‎Hei.

312
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:28,685
‎Betulkah itu peta Kolam Lelaki Lemas?

313
00:20:30,270 --> 00:20:32,980
‎Kenapa aku tak jadi lelaki balik?

314
00:20:32,981 --> 00:20:35,150
‎Cakaplah, khinzir!

315
00:20:43,075 --> 00:20:45,534
<i>‎Kolam Lelaki Lemas Jepun</i>

316
00:20:45,535 --> 00:20:48,955
<i>‎yang anda kunjungi bertahun-tahun
‎sudah ditutup.</i>

317
00:20:48,956 --> 00:20:51,499
<i>‎Sila kunjungi Kolam Lelaki Lemas asal</i>

318
00:20:51,500 --> 00:20:54,127
<i>‎di Jusenkyo, China jika ada keperluan.</i>

319
00:20:55,337 --> 00:20:58,298
‎Jadi, ini kolam air panas biasa?

320
00:20:58,882 --> 00:21:02,760
‎Hei! Siapa buat? Siapa pecahkan paip air?

321
00:21:02,761 --> 00:21:04,263
‎Ranma.

322
00:21:08,600 --> 00:21:10,851
‎Mana atuk dapat seluar dalam itu?

323
00:21:10,852 --> 00:21:12,187
‎Atuk beli.

324
00:21:15,482 --> 00:21:19,068
‎Kenapa, P-chan? Awak tak bermaya.

325
00:21:19,069 --> 00:21:23,115
‎Aku rasa kau lagi bahagia
‎kalau terus jadi begini.

326
00:22:57,042 --> 00:23:02,047
{\an8}‎Terjemahan sari kata oleh Aizat Bahri

